{"id":"estilo","lemma":"estilo","pos":"noun","rank":848,"glosses":["style (way of doing things)","style (grace; fashionable skill)","style"],"ipa":"/esˈtilo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"estilos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-estilo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gusta tu estilo.","en":"I like your style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443919"},{"text":"No es mi estilo.","en":"It's not my style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444521"},{"text":"No es tu estilo.","en":"It's not your style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449019"},{"text":"No dije nada por el estilo.","en":"I said nothing of the sort.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76934"},{"text":"El escritor tiene un estilo excelente.","en":"The writer has an excellent style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768004"}]}